Z||000007||mrfiero||10-11-2001||04:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Old Lar:<BR><B>87 models were the first to have the Getrag 5 speed transmission except for the few 86 GT's that had the new 5 speeds put in during late production run of the 86.<BR>So I would expect that any 87 SE V6 that had a manual transmission, it was a 5 speed.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>All late '86 V-6 Fieros (both GT & SE) got the 5-sp. Getrag.  Like I said above, the vast majority of '86 SE's with sticks are 4-speeds, but there are some 5-speeds floating around (I used to own one!).<P>You are correct in that <B>ALL</B> '87-'88 V-6 Fieros came with the Getrag 5-sp.<BR>||||reg||1
